00:35:30,460 --> 00:35:33,840
And if the database physically isn't built to hold a context tag,

801
00:35:34,040 --> 00:35:37,940
if there is no column for year, it crosses over into operational loss.

802
00:35:38,140 --> 00:35:39,320
The past is erased.

803
00:35:39,600 --> 00:35:45,020
The chronological geometry of Alice's life is permanently collapsed into a flat, contradictory state.

